[h1]Strata — Update[/h1]

[b]Added[/b]
[list]
[*] [b]Cave mods stay separate[/b] — Anomaly undercaves, Deep And Deeper, and similar portals are no longer treated as your colony floors for work / food / rest / alerts. Optional setting: Relay into other mods' portal maps (off by default).
[*] Toggle for [b]underground infestations[/b] on B1+ floors.
[*] Stairwells remember their partner and auto-relink when possible.
[/list]

[b]Improved[/b]
[list]
[*] Work relay is smoother (less stair looping, wakes faster when new jobs appear).
[*] Digging a new floor freezes less; rock fills in with a progress bar.
[*] Workshop / About description updated for Version 3.
[/list]

[b]Fixed[/b]
[list]
[*] [b]Prioritize haul to basement storage[/b] — greyed "no accessible spot" is vanilla (this map only). [i]Haul to another level[/i] finds empty shelves on B1+, only uses a shaft with a walkable path to that stockpile, and auto-haul follows the same vanilla "needs haul" rules then finishes into the chosen shelf like a normal haul job.
[*] [b]Climbing upstairs crash[/b] — orphan / unlinked landings no longer hard-error when a pawn goes up (missing entrance link).
[*] [b]Auto haul to another floor[/b] — loot that only Force haul would move downstairs now hauls on its own when a better stockpile is linked (check Allowed Areas if piles are outside Home).
[*] Mountain digs / towers keep mineable rock instead of empty voids.
[*] Biomes! mountain digs that came out hollow get a diggable warren.
[*] Better soft-compat with Adaptive Storage / Neat / Hauler's Dream (fewer haul loops).
[*] Low Food / Low Medicine count stockpiles on every linked floor.
[*] Mental breaks can chase across stairs.
[*] Orphan / unlinked stairs can be deconstructed again.
[*] Haulers and Misc. Robots keep returning upstairs for the next load.
[*] Force-build and prioritize across floors (including Ideology / turrets).
[*] Mod Options shows all toggles again.
[/list]

[i]Build stamp (Player.log): haul-needs-parity-v1[/i]
